# Old Fat Spider Can't See Me: "I - Target creature you control gains hexproof for as long as this Saga remains on the battlefield. II - Prevent all damage that would
# be dealt by up to one target creature for as long as this Saga remains on the battlefield. III, IV - Draw a card." (CR 611.2b, 615.) Chapter I (turn 1) gives
# Bot1's Ornithopter hexproof: Bot2's Lightning Bolt cannot target it (the refusal). Chapter II (turn 3) stops Bot2's Grizzly Bears: on turn 4 it and
# Llanowar Elves attack and only the Elves' 1 damage lands (19). Chapters III and IV each draw (library 20 to 15 with the three draw steps). After chapter IV the
# Saga is sacrificed (CR 714.4) and both effects end: on turn 8 the Bears and Elves deal 3 (16) and the Bolt kills the Ornithopter.

